#: src/postulo/templates/documents/cv_form.html
msgid "The first choice in each list follows your details: mark another number as primary there and this CV prints it. One you choose here stays, whatever becomes primary. If you later delete it from your details, this CV prints none of that kind until you choose again, and never another in its place. What you have already sent does not change."
msgstr "Zerrenda bakoitzeko lehen aukerak zure datuei jarraitzen die: markatu beste zenbaki bat nagusi gisa han, eta CV honek hura inprimatuko du. Hemen aukeratzen duzuna geratu egiten da, nagusi bihurtzen dena bihurtzen dela ere. Geroago zure datuetatik ezabatzen baduzu, CV honek ez du mota horretakorik inprimatuko berriro aukeratu arte, eta inoiz ez beste bat haren ordez. Dagoeneko bidali duzuna ez da aldatzen."

